    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every level is a new game!</h2><br>Each level in Planet Rhythm has unique mechanics! Explore the different rhythm worlds with your charismatic alien sidekick Fuoco and uncover the secrets that bind them all together!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121710/extras/78abc4a8a70d1d20109ddbe855b80fdc.avif?t=1662418678\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your rhythm skills!</h2><br>Planet Rhythm is a game where you are challenged to precisely match your inputs with in-game songs, resulting in a satisfying visual display where game and music become one in the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What can you expect? </h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 12 Well crafted levels!<br></li><li> Amazing soundtrack!<br></li><li> Handmade pixel art!<br></li><li> Crisp input that sends shivers down your spine!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121710/extras/546bc7a0cc780473de06df3e6d37d386.poster.avif?t=1662418678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121710/extras/546bc7a0cc780473de06df3e6d37d386.webm?t=1662418678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every level is a new game!</h2><br>Each level in Planet Rhythm has unique mechanics! Explore the different rhythm worlds with your charismatic alien sidekick Fuoco and uncover the secrets that bind them all together!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121710/extras/78abc4a8a70d1d20109ddbe855b80fdc.avif?t=1662418678\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your rhythm skills!</h2><br>Planet Rhythm is a game where you are challenged to precisely match your inputs with in-game songs, resulting in a satisfying visual display where game and music become one in the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What can you expect? </h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 12 Well crafted levels!<br></li><li> Amazing soundtrack!<br></li><li> Handmade pixel art!<br></li><li> Crisp input that sends shivers down your spine!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121710/extras/546bc7a0cc780473de06df3e6d37d386.poster.avif?t=1662418678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121710/extras/546bc7a0cc780473de06df3e6d37d386.webm?t=1662418678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
